---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { LOCALES } from '../i18n/utils';
---

<Layout
	title="About | Heejun's Net"
	heading="About"
	description="About this site and who writes it"
	availableLocales={LOCALES}
	schemaType="AboutPage"
>
	<p>
		I like losing my way and wandering in the forest of development, I follow the threads of
		curious thoughts without end, and I lose my head entirely over thoughts about existence and
		a devotion to the beauty of food. What is this being that I am? Do I exist? Who am I to
		you?
	</p>

	<h2>What's here</h2>
	<p>
		This blog is split into four sections: <a href="/developer/">Developer</a> for problems
		hit while building things, <a href="/roamer/">Roamer</a> for places wandered through
		around Australia, <a href="/melophile/">Melophile</a> for music worth returning to, and
		<a href="/foodie/">Foodie</a> for places in Adelaide and Melbourne worth going back to.
	</p>

	<h2>On the languages</h2>
	<p>
		Every post is written in Korean first, then translated into English, Chinese, Thai and
		Vietnamese. Use the language switcher at the bottom of any page to move between them.
	</p>

	<h2>Elsewhere</h2>
	<p>
		<a href="https://github.com/popul9" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
		{' · '}
		<a
			href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/heejun-moon-dev/"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a
		>
	</p>
</Layout>
